<title>CANADA: Canada Q4 GDP price deflator rises 0.6 percent.</title>
<headline>Canada Q4 GDP price deflator rises 0.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's implicit price index for calculation of gross domestic product at market prices rose 0.6 percent in the fourth quarter of 1996 to 130.2 (base 1986) after a 0.7 pct rise in the third quarter, Statistics Canada said on Friday.</p>
<p>Economists surveyed by Reuters had forecast a rise of 0.6 percent in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745))</p>
